What is a Tunnel Car Wash System?
Tunnel car wash systems are fully automated vehicle cleaning solutions that utilize conveyor belts to transport vehicles through a sequenced cleaning process. These systems typically include pre-soak applications, high-pressure rinsing, foam brushing, spot-free rinsing, and powerful drying stages. Unlike traditional manual washing, tunnel systems provide consistent cleaning quality while significantly reducing water consumption through advanced recycling technologies.

These systems are predominantly used in commercial settings due to their ability to handle high volumes of both passenger vehicles and commercial fleets. Modern tunnel washes incorporate sophisticated technologies including optical sensors, programmable logic controllers, and water reclamation systems that can recycle up to 85% of water used during the washing process.

